      }
    ],
    "summary": "I couldn't build five drawers into a single hex base: the configurator won't allow it. A full base has no place for a drawer at all. I've built a single-storey north half base with the one drawer it accepts, and nothing beside or on top of it. If the base is stacked three storeys high, it takes up to 3 drawers, but that puts bases on top and still falls short of five."
  },
